; A balance is checked at the start of its date, before the transactions of that
; day, whatever its `time`: beancount knows no times. The pad of the day before pads
; the 100 the balance asserts, and lunch, later that day, leaves 70.
option "operating_currency" "CNY"

1970-01-01 commodity CNY
1970-01-01 open Assets:A
1970-01-01 open Equity:Open
1970-01-01 open Expenses:Food

2024-03-02 * "Shop" "lunch"
  time: "12:00:00"
  Expenses:Food  30 CNY
  Assets:A

2024-03-01 pad Assets:A Equity:Open
2024-03-02 balance Assets:A  100 CNY
  time: "20:00:00"
2024-03-03 balance Assets:A  70 CNY
